        <briefdescription>
<para>Convert raw waitpid status to shell exit code. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>get exit status from wait status</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Normal exit: WEXITSTATUS (0-255)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Killed by signal: 128 + signal number <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>wstatus</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The waitpid status. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The shell exit code. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
